  "body": "When using CAS you currently need to define a `cas_service_url` in the homeserver configuration. This ends up being a duplicate of the `public_baseurl` configuration and should be fairly easy to get rid of.\r\n\r\nReasons for doing this:\r\n* Not having duplicated config is good. 👍 \r\n* This will match what SAML requires.\r\n\r\nWe'll need to deprecate the old option before just outright removing it.",
